---
source: src/relish/wtf/diagnose.rs
expression: report_rows(&report)
---
CRITICAL [node-dead] node node-3 is Dead
CRITICAL [unreachable-nodes] node node-3 did not answer its Bun API
UNKNOWN [builds] the 2 nodes that answered run bun v0.1.2 (3fcb1fd), sha256 aaaa1111bbbb; node node-3: version: timed out after 10s
OK [alerts] no relevant alerts are firing
OK [certificates] all observed certificates are currently valid with healthy automatic rotation
OK [council] council quorum healthy (1/1)
OK [cpu-throttling] no application accumulated throttled CPU time
OK [crashloops] no applications have three timestamped restarts in 15 minutes
OK [deploys] no deploy has been active for more than 15 minutes
OK [disks] all observed storage domains are below 85% usage
OK [faults] no active Smoker faults
OK [registry] Pickle is reachable and its known layers meet the redundancy target
OK [replicas] every app runs its desired replicas
OK [services] all deployed services have a healthy backend
OK [tokens] no API token expires within 14 days, and no admin token is past 90 days
